{"v":1,"book":"Isa","ch":31,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Woe to those who go down to Egypt for help; They rely on horses And trust in chariots because they are many And in horsemen because they are very strong; But they do not look to the Holy One of Israel, Nor seek Jehovah!","tok":[{"t":"Woe","s":["H1945"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to those who go "},{"t":"down","s":["H3381"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[2]},{"t":" for "},{"t":"help","s":["H5833"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; They rely on "},{"t":"horses","s":["H5483"],"a":[5]},{"t":" And "},{"t":"trust","s":["H0982"],"a":[7]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"chariots","s":["H7393"],"a":[9]},{"t":" because they are "},{"t":"many","s":["H7227"],"a":[11]},{"t":" And in "},{"t":"horsemen","s":["H6571"],"a":[13]},{"t":" because they are "},{"t":"very","s":["H3966"],"a":[16]},{"t":" "},{"t":"strong","s":["H6105"],"a":[15]},{"t":"; But they do not "},{"t":"look","s":["H8159"],"a":[18]},{"t":" to the Holy "},{"t":"One","s":["H6918"],"a":[20]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[21]},{"t":", Nor "},{"t":"seek","s":["H1875"],"a":[25]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[23]},{"t":"!"}]},{"n":2,"text":"But He also is wise and will bring ill upon them; And He does not turn back His words, But will rise up against the house of evildoers And against the help of the workers of iniquity.","tok":[{"t":"But He also is "},{"t":"wise","s":["H2450"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and will "},{"t":"bring","s":["H0935"],"a":[3]},{"t":" ill upon them; And He does not turn "},{"t":"back","s":["H5493"],"a":[8]},{"t":" His "},{"t":"words","s":["H1697"],"a":[6]},{"t":", But will rise up against the "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[11]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"evildoers","s":["H7489"],"a":[12]},{"t":" And against the "},{"t":"help","s":["H5833"],"a":[14]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"workers","s":["H6466"],"a":[15]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"iniquity","s":["H0205"],"a":[16]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"The Egyptians are mere men and not God, And their horses are mere flesh and not spirit; Thus Jehovah will stretch out His hand, And he who helps will stumble and he who is helped will fall, And all of them will be consumed together.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"Egyptians","s":["H4714"],"a":[0]},{"t":" are mere "},{"t":"men","s":["H0120"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and not "},{"t":"God","s":["H0410"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And their "},{"t":"horses","s":["H5483"],"a":[4]},{"t":" are mere "},{"t":"flesh","s":["H1320"],"a":[5]},{"t":" and not "},{"t":"spirit","s":["H7307"],"a":[7]},{"t":"; Thus "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[8]},{"t":" will stretch "},{"t":"out","s":["H5186"],"a":[9]},{"t":" His "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[10]},{"t":", And he who "},{"t":"helps","s":["H5826"],"a":[12]},{"t":" will stumble and he who is helped will "},{"t":"fall","s":["H3782"],"a":[11]},{"t":", And all of them will be consumed "},{"t":"together","s":["H3162"],"a":[15]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"For Jehovah has spoken thus to me, As the lion or the lion cub Roars over its prey And because of it a crowd of shepherds Is called out, But it is not frightened by their voice, Nor overcome by their noise; So Jehovah of hosts will descend To wage war on Mount Zion and on its hill.","tok":[{"t":"For "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"spoken","s":["H0559"],"a":[2]},{"t":" thus to me, As the "},{"t":"lion","s":["H0738"],"a":[7]},{"t":" or the "},{"t":"lion","s":["H3715"],"a":[8]},{"t":" cub "},{"t":"Roars","s":["H1897"],"a":[6]},{"t":" over its "},{"t":"prey","s":["H2964"],"a":[10]},{"t":" And because of it a crowd of "},{"t":"shepherds","s":["H7462"],"a":[15]},{"t":" Is called out, But it is not frightened by their "},{"t":"voice","s":["H6963"],"a":[16]},{"t":", Nor overcome by their "},{"t":"noise","s":["H1995"],"a":[19]},{"t":"; So "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[24]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[25]},{"t":" will descend To wage war on "},{"t":"Mount","s":["H2022"],"a":[28]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Zion","s":["H6726"],"a":[29]},{"t":" and on its "},{"t":"hill","s":["H1389"],"a":[31]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Like flying birds So Jehovah of hosts will protect Jerusalem; He will protect and deliver it; He will pass over and rescue it.","tok":[{"t":"Like","s":["H6833"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"flying","s":["H5774"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"birds","s":["H6833"],"a":[0]},{"t":" So "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[5]},{"t":" will protect "},{"t":"Jerusalem","s":["H3389"],"a":[7]},{"t":"; He will protect and "},{"t":"deliver","s":["H5337"],"a":[9]},{"t":" it; He will pass "},{"t":"over","s":["H6452"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"rescue","s":["H4422"],"a":[11]},{"t":" it."}]},{"n":6,"text":"Return to Him from whom men have deeply revolted, O children of Israel.","tok":[{"t":"Return to Him from whom men have "},{"t":"deeply","s":["H6009"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"revolted","s":["H5627"],"a":[3]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"children","s":["H1121"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"For in that day each man will cast away his idols of silver and his idols of gold, which your hands have made for you as a sin.","tok":[{"t":"For in that "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[1]},{"t":" each "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[4]},{"t":" will cast "},{"t":"away","s":["H3988"],"a":[3]},{"t":" his "},{"t":"idols","s":["H0457"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"silver","s":["H3701"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and his "},{"t":"idols","s":["H0457"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"gold","s":["H2091"],"a":[8]},{"t":", which your "},{"t":"hands","s":["H3027"],"a":[12]},{"t":" have "},{"t":"made","s":["H6213"],"a":[10]},{"t":" for you as a "},{"t":"sin","s":["H2399"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"And the Assyrian will fall by the sword not of a man, And the sword not of man will devour him. Thus he will flee from a sword, And his young men will be forced into labor.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"Assyrian","s":["H0804"],"a":[1]},{"t":" will